\
Explain the distinction between:\
\
1. Digital measurements\
2. Performance outcome assessments\
3. Biological biomarkers\
4. Exploratory endpoints\
5. Qualified or validated endpoints\
\
Describe how new measurements progress from technical\
verification through analytical and clinical validation\
